 <p class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaDescription__GXkLd\">\n      Excellent\n    </p> <h3 class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardMediaName__VGyRp\">\n      XFastest\n    </h3></div> <div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottom__YN1CY\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottomLeft__qC0ZC\"><span>TAIWAN</span> <span>04/01/2022</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG STRIX Z690-I GAMING WIFI media of XFastest\" href=\"https://www.xfastest.com/thread-260664-1-1.html\" tabindex=\"0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItemMoreLink__-qKRC\" style=\"display:;\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItem__q7gyE\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemTop__AvYOk\"><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Tweakers.net\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaImageBox__wHmrh\" style=\"background-image:url(https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1312/202009031830135250597.png);\"><!----></div> <p class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaDescription__GXkLd\">\n      ASUS is traditionally well represented in the high-end segment.\n    </p> <h3 class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardMediaName__VGyRp\">\n      Tweakers.net\n    </h3></div> <div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottom__YN1CY\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottomLeft__qC0ZC\"><span>NETHERLANDS</span> <span>01/21/2022</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG STRIX Z690-I GAMING WIFI media of Tweakers.net\" href=\"https://tweakers.net/reviews/9726/all/17-intel-z690-moederborden-met-ddr5-topmobos-voor-supersnel-geheugen.html#anchor_top\" tabindex=\"0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItemMoreLink__-qKRC\" style=\"display:;\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItem__q7gyE\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemTop__AvYOk\"><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"電腦DIY\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaImageBox__wHmrh\" style=\"background-image:url(https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1349/202103251555060670828.jpg);\"><!----></div> <p class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaDescription__GXkLd\">\n      這片主機板搭載 Intel Z690 LGA 1700 ，尺寸為迷你的 ITX ，內建 PCIe 5.0、 10+1 power stages、雙向 AI 降噪設計、 AI 自動超頻、 AI 降熱、 AI 聯網、無線 WiFi 6E (802.11ax)與有線的 Intel 2.5 Gb Ethernet。堆疊式兩組 M.2 slots還有強大的散熱片，內建兩組 Thunderbolt 4 / USB Type-C，以及 Aura RGB燈效等優異設計！\n    </p> <h3 class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardMediaName__VGyRp\">\n      電腦DIY\n    </h3></div> <div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottom__YN1CY\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottomLeft__qC0ZC\"><span>TAIWAN</span> <span>10/28/2021</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG STRIX Z690-I GAMING WIFI media of 電腦DIY\" href=\"https://www.computerdiy.com.tw/rog-strix-z690-i-gaming-wifi/\" tabindex=\"0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItemMoreLink__-qKRC\" style=\"display:;\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItem__q7gyE\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemTop__AvYOk\"><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"BENCHLIFE\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaImageBox__wHmrh\" style=\"background-image:url(https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1349/202008240957573060703.png);\"><!----></div> <p class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaDescription__GXkLd\">\n      ITX 小歸小，但 I/O 配置也算相當齊全，甚至連 Thunderbolt 4 都已經幫你準備就緒，就看你的預算有沒有足夠應付價格不便宜的 Thunderbolt 4 裝置；Intel 2.5GbE 以及 Intel Wi-Fi 6E 無線網路配置，也相當足夠應付絕大部分的日常需求。\n    </p> <h3 class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardMediaName__VGyRp\">\n      BENCHLIFE\n    </h3></div> <div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottom__YN1CY\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottomLeft__qC0ZC\"><span>TAIWAN</span> <span>10/28/2021</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG STRIX Z690-I GAMING WIFI media of BENCHLIFE\" href=\"https://benchlife.info/rog-strix-z690-i-gaming-wifi-itx-motherboard-unbox/\" tabindex=\"0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItemMoreLink__-qKRC\" style=\"display:;\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItem__q7gyE\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemTop__AvYOk\"><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"癮科技\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaImageBox__wHmrh\" style=\"background-image:url(https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1349/202008240956539720471.png);\"><!----></div> <p class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaDescription__GXkLd\">\n      ROG STRIX Z690-I GAMING WIFI 延續華碩 ROG Strix 在頂級晶片組盡可能提供完整功能與極致設計的精神，使著重全功能與極致性的玩家能在 17x17 的格局取得相對完整的 I/O 與功能，並從包括散熱、組裝等賦予貼心的設計，畢竟會選擇 ITX 格局的 Z690 玩家不太可能是價位導向，是必要再設具與布局設法滿足這些狂熱者的需求。\n    </p> <h3 class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardMediaName__VGyRp\">\n      癮科技\n    </h3></div> <div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottom__YN1CY\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottomLeft__qC0ZC\"><span>TAIWAN</span> <span>10/29/2021</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG STRIX Z690-I GAMING WIFI media of 癮科技\" href=\"https://www.cool3c.com/article/167728\" tabindex=\"0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItemMoreLink__-qKRC\" style=\"display:;\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItem__q7gyE\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemTop__AvYOk\"><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"滄者極限\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaImageBox__wHmrh\" style=\"background-image:url(https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1349/202206291858291040730.png);\"><!----></div> <p class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaDescription__GXkLd\">\n      Excellent\n    </p> <h3 class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardMediaName__VGyRp\">\n      滄者極限\n    </h3></div> <div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottom__YN1CY\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottomLeft__qC0ZC\"><span>TAIWAN</span> <span>04/01/2022</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG STRIX Z690-I GAMING WIFI media of 滄者極限\" href=\"https://www.coolaler.com/forums/threads/asus-39.367622/\" tabindex=\"0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItemMoreLink__-qKRC\" style=\"display:;\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItem__q7gyE\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemTop__AvYOk\"><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"AKIBA PC Hot line!\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaImageBox__wHmrh\" style=\"background-image:url(https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1261/202205091652439070934.png);\"><!----></div> <p class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaDescription__GXkLd\">\n      Verification! How far can a Mini-ITX mother with the powerful Z690 drive the mighty power consumption of the Core i9-12900K?\n    </p> <h3 class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardMediaName__VGyRp\">\n      AKIBA PC Hot line!\n    </h3></div> <div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottom__YN1CY\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottomLeft__qC0ZC\"><span>JAPAN</span> <span>12/01/2021</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG STRIX Z690-I GAMING WIFI media of AKIBA PC Hot line!\" href=\"https://akiba-pc.watch.impress.co.jp/docs/topic/special/1369756.html\" tabindex=\"0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItemMoreLink__-qKRC\" style=\"display:;\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItem__q7gyE\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemTop__AvYOk\"><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Self-made, games and hobby days\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaImageBox__wHmrh\" style=\"background-image:url(https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1261/202205091652439070934.png);\"><!----></div> <p class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaDescription__GXkLd\">\n      「ASUS ROG STRIX Z690-I GAMING WIFI」をレビュー\n    </p> <h3 class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardMediaName__VGyRp\">\n      Self-made, games and hobby days\n    </h3></div> <div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem_